Z||000012||GREENDANO||12-19-1999||06:41 PM||||Hey everybody.  Thanks for the great comments.  I actually traded my GT for an F40 rebody on an 86 SE chassis a month ago.  You should see that one.  I've wanted this car for almost two years.  I have it now!<BR>  To everyone considering this kind of project....Double your budget!  This car was in need of a lot of finish work, and I decided to do a suspension/urethane upgrade while the car was in the air.  <BR>  I'll have pictures of my psuedo cross drilled rotors soon, I'm picking up a digital camera tomorow.  <BR> Dan-O||||reg||10
